---
import TerminalLayout from '../../layouts/TerminalLayout.astro';
---

<TerminalLayout title="Component Lab — OpenView">
  <main class="min-h-screen bg-[#0b0e14] text-[#d1d4dc]">
    <header class="flex h-12 items-center justify-between border-b border-[#2a2e39] bg-[#131722] px-4">
      <a href="/" class="text-sm font-semibold text-white no-underline">OpenView</a>
      <span class="text-xs text-[#787b86]">TradingView Component Lab</span>
    </header>
    <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-6xl gap-8 px-5 py-8 md:grid-cols-[220px_minmax(0,1fr)]">
      <aside class="space-y-2">
        <p class="mb-3 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-[#787b86]">Componentes</p>
        <a href="/component-lab/core/buttons" class="block rounded-md bg-[#2962ff]/10 px-3 py-2 text-sm text-[#6b9eff] no-underline">Buttons & Controls</a>
        <a href="/component-lab/core/toolbars" class="block rounded-md px-3 py-2 text-sm text-[#b2b5be] no-underline hover:bg-[#1e222d] hover:text-white">Toolbars · Drawing tools</a>
        <a href="/component-lab/core/icons" class="block rounded-md px-3 py-2 text-sm text-[#b2b5be] no-underline hover:bg-[#1e222d] hover:text-white">Icons · Lucide</a>
        <a href="/component-lab/navigation" class="block rounded-md px-3 py-2 text-sm text-[#b2b5be] no-underline hover:bg-[#1e222d] hover:text-white">Navigation · Tabs & Menus</a>
        <a href="/component-lab/forms" class="block rounded-md px-3 py-2 text-sm text-[#b2b5be] no-underline hover:bg-[#1e222d] hover:text-white">Forms · Inputs & Selects</a>
        <a href="/component-lab/dialogs" class="block rounded-md px-3 py-2 text-sm text-[#b2b5be] no-underline hover:bg-[#1e222d] hover:text-white">Dialogs · Modals</a>
        <p class="px-3 py-2 text-xs text-[#5d606b]">Trading · próximamente</p>
        <p class="px-3 py-2 text-xs text-[#5d606b]">Chart · próximamente</p>
        <p class="px-3 py-2 text-xs text-[#5d606b]">Panels · próximamente</p>
      </aside>
      <section class="space-y-4">
        <div>
          <p class="text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-[#2962ff]">Design system</p>
          <h1 class="mt-2 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-white">Component Lab</h1>
          <p class="mt-2 max-w-2xl text-sm leading-6 text-[#787b86]">Entorno aislado para inspeccionar, probar y validar cada componente antes de integrarlo en el terminal.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-2">
          <a href="/component-lab/core/buttons" class="rounded-md border border-[#2a2e39] bg-[#131722] p-4 no-underline transition-colors hover:border-[#434651]">
            <span class="text-sm font-semibold text-[#d1d4dc]">Buttons & Controls</span>
            <p class="mt-1 text-xs leading-5 text-[#787b86]">Button, IconButton, Tooltip, Badge y Divider.</p>
          </a>
          <a href="/component-lab/core/toolbars" class="rounded-md border border-[#2a2e39] bg-[#131722] p-4 no-underline transition-colors hover:border-[#434651]"><span class="text-sm font-semibold text-[#d1d4dc]">Toolbars</span><p class="mt-1 text-xs leading-5 text-[#787b86]">Barras agrupadas, estados activos y navegación por teclado.</p></a>
          <a href="/component-lab/core/icons" class="rounded-md border border-[#2a2e39] bg-[#131722] p-4 no-underline transition-colors hover:border-[#434651]"><span class="text-sm font-semibold text-[#d1d4dc]">Icons</span><p class="mt-1 text-xs leading-5 text-[#787b86]">Catálogo Lucide con tamaños y accesibilidad estandarizados.</p></a>
          <a href="/component-lab/forms" class="rounded-md border border-[#2a2e39] bg-[#131722] p-4 no-underline transition-colors hover:border-[#434651]">
            <span class="text-sm font-semibold text-[#d1d4dc]">Forms</span>
            <p class="mt-1 text-xs leading-5 text-[#787b86]">TextField, Select, estados y tamaños.</p>
          </a>
          <a href="/component-lab/navigation" class="rounded-md border border-[#2a2e39] bg-[#131722] p-4 no-underline transition-colors hover:border-[#434651]">
            <span class="text-sm font-semibold text-[#d1d4dc]">Navigation</span>
            <p class="mt-1 text-xs leading-5 text-[#787b86]">Tabs accesibles y menús desplegables.</p>
          </a>
          <a href="/component-lab/dialogs" class="rounded-md border border-[#2a2e39] bg-[#131722] p-4 no-underline transition-colors hover:border-[#434651]">
            <span class="text-sm font-semibold text-[#d1d4dc]">Dialogs</span>
            <p class="mt-1 text-xs leading-5 text-[#787b86]">Ventanas modales, foco y cierre contextual.</p>
          </a>
        </div>
      </section>
    </div>
  </main>
</TerminalLayout>
